==Miscellaneous==
*Added [[Agent Staal (Uber Rare Cat)|Agent Staal]] to [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].
*Added [[Anniversary/11th Year|11th]] and [[Anniversary/11 1/2 Year|11.5 Anniversary]] content to BCEN.
*Added [[Anniversary/11 1/2 Year|11.5 Anniversary]] content to BCKR.
*Added 3 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**25,600 grants +5 Special Catseyes.
**25,700 grants +5 Rare Catseyes.
**25,800 grants +5 Super Rare Catseyes.
*Raised [[Catburger (Special Cat)|Catburger]]'s + level cap from +30 to +35.
*Raised [[Maneki Cat (Special Cat)|Maneki Cat]] and [[Coin Cat (Special Cat)|Coin Cat]]'s + level caps from +35 to +40.
*Raised [[Farmer Cat (Special Cat)|Farmer Cat]]'s + level cap from +20 to +25.
*Raised [[Million-Dollar Cat (Special Cat)|Million-Dollar Cat]] and [[Meditation Cat (Special Cat)|Meditation Cat]]'s + level caps from +15 to +20.
*Added 5 new [[Talent Orbs|Ability Orb]] types:
**'''Single Surge Counter ''' (１回烈波カウンター ''1-kai Reppa Kauntā''): Every second unit deployed will do a [[Counter-Surge]] that deals 10%~100% of the unit's damage the first time it is hit by a [[Surge Attack]]. Does not stack with pre-existing Counter-Surge abilities. When two are equipped by the same unit, only one will take effect; the higher-Ranked Orb has priority. Cannot by equipped by [[:Category:Cats with Surge Immunity|Cats with Surge Immunity]].
**'''Berserker''' (撃破時攻撃力アップ ''Gekiha-ji Kōgeki-ryoku Appu''): Increases attack power by 3~20% after defeating 10 enemies. Stacks multiplicatively with pre-existing Strengthen abilities. When two are equipped by the same unit, only one will take effect; the higher-Ranked Orb has priority.
**'''Shortened Cooldown''' (生産時間短縮 ''Seisan Jikan Tanshuku''): Every second unit deployed starts their cooldown with 2~15% of their cooldown already completed. When two are equipped by the same unit, only one will take effect; the higher-Ranked Orb has priority.
**'''Resist Freeze''' (動きを止める耐性 ''Ugoki o Tomeru Taisei''): Reduces the duration of freeze effects by 5-50%. Can stack with another Resist Freeze Orb or Resist Freeze [[Talents]] to become immunity.
**'''Resist Weaken''' (攻撃力ダウン耐性 ''Kōgeki-ryoku Daun Taisei''): Reduces the duration of weaken effects by 5-50%. Can stack with another Resist Weaken Orb or Resist Weaken [[Talents]] to become immunity.
*Added Talent Orbs to the [[Cat Filter]], allowing you to filter units by which Orbs they have equipped.
*Added a "Potential" option to the Cat Filter settings:
**Units that do not currently possess a selected target Trait/ability yet can be given them through Evolution or Talents will be included when the setting is checked, indicated by a small icon on the top-right of the Evolve/Talents button.
*The Cat Filter icon will now turn red when it is in use.
*The Cat Filter will now remain active when entering/exiting the Upgrade Menu.
*After using 2 [[Battle Items#Cat CPU|Cat CPUs]] to skip an [[:Category:XP Guerrilla Stages|XP Guerrilla Stage]], you can watch an ad to get double XP. This can be done up to 3 times a day.

